    "detailed_description": "This is a side-scrolling  shoot 'em up game in which players fight by using both the close-range &quot;sword&quot; to slash enemies and shatter bullet barrages, and the far-reaching &quot;shooting&quot; style.<br>Players can learn techniques with various effects during the stage and can take on the mighty bosses in the style of their choice.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797420/extras/08070f8becb247e09324a1596d2a3a71.poster.avif?t=1746432303\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797420/extras/08070f8becb247e09324a1596d2a3a71.webm?t=1746432303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797420/extras/08070f8becb247e09324a1596d2a3a71.mp4?t=1746432303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2>The game features action with the sword, by wielding the sword,<br> Attack the enemy<br> Eliminate some bullets<br> Parry and nullify enemy melee attacks<br>and other actions are possible.<br><br>With the sword, power is accumulated and special techniques such as &quot;Iai&quot; and &quot;Ougi&quot; can be unleashed.<br>There are also challenging elements, such as reinforcement only during the stage with spiritual power obtained by defeating enemies, or permanent reinforcement with coins obtained by defeating bosses.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797420/extras/c14762ddddf2f28afc5ab71ce01cedfe.poster.avif?t=1746432303\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797420/extras/c14762ddddf2f28afc5ab71ce01cedfe.webm?t=1746432303\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797420/extras/c14762ddddf2f28afc5ab71ce01cedfe.mp4?t=1746432303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2>The time is turbulent.<br>Two divine swords, Kuroyuri and Shiroyuri, were dedicated deep in the mountains of Kyoto.<br>Their powerful power was only there to keep the demons and evil spirits from doing evil.<br><br>One day, a large thunderbolt destroyed the shrine and the sheath where the sword was located.<br>When left unarmed, the sword's power waned and it could not glare at the enemy.<br>They took the form of a person on one side and a sword on the other, and when fighting the enemy, they kept the sword inside their bodies. <br>Their journey to defeat the monsters and demons that abound in the world and to obtain a new sheath begins.",
