src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797420/extras/c14762ddddf2f28afc5ab71ce01cedfe.mp4?t=1746432303\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2>The time is turbulent.<br>Two divine swords, Kuroyuri and Shiroyuri, were dedicated deep in the mountains of Kyoto.<br>Their powerful power was only there to keep the demons and evil spirits from doing evil.<br><br>One day, a large thunderbolt destroyed the shrine and the sheath where the sword was located.<br>When left unarmed, the sword's power waned and it could not glare at the enemy.<br>They took the form of a person on one side and a sword on the other, and when fighting the enemy, they kept the sword inside their bodies. <br>Their journey to defeat the monsters and demons that abound in the world and to obtain a new sheath begins.",
    "short_description": "This is a side-scrolling shoot 'em up game set in a beautifully drawn Japanese world where you can slay enemies and bullets with simple controls. Parry enemy attacks and use a variety of special moves to defeat powerful demons and evil monsters.",
